model c3_one_of
  tally 2
  on 2026-06-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
  note "T, tally 2.3 G3 (#247, rulings 2 and 13): `one_of` leaves the language and is refused anywhere, LOAD-PARSE at its row; a day one of a few is written as an axis or a stated day marked assumed (L §4.4). Written at C2, stored at the third pin."
source s "invented"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2025-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input d: date
input amt: money PLN
move pay: transfers
  on d
  leg cash from world to konto amount amt
version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2025-01-01
  d = one_of([2026-03-02, 2026-03-09]) "s"
  amt = 100.00 PLN "s"
  opening[konto] = 500.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"
ask b: bal(konto, 2026-03-31)
